 "summary": "client_request_timeout is the primary value: Envoy request_timeout plus gateway_grpc_auth_service_timeout must be below it, nginx_read_timeout must be at most the Envoy request_timeout, and python_webserver_timeout at most nginx_read_timeout.",
 "questions": [
  "How do the AAP timeout settings relate to each other?",
  "What is client_request_timeout?",
  "nginx_read_timeout versus python_webserver_timeout"
 ],
 "answer_card": {
  "title": "Timeout relationships",
  "answer_md": "- `request_timeout` (Envoy) + `gateway_grpc_auth_service_timeout` < `client_request_timeout`\n- `nginx_read_timeout` ≤ Envoy `request_timeout`\n- `python_webserver_timeout` ≤ `nginx_read_timeout`",
